<title>NETHERLANDS: ENDEMOL UPS CIRCUSTHEATER STAKE TO 100 PCT.</title>
<headline>ENDEMOL UPS CIRCUSTHEATER STAKE TO 100 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Endemol said on Monday it had raised its stake in the Circustheater entertainment venue in the Dutch seaside resort of Scheveningen to 100 percent.</p>
</text>
